TRAIN @ Stormwind City, 49.6, 85.8 | Jennea Cannon, in the Wizard's Sanctum in the Mage Quarter, south-west of the gryphon master: learn your level 16 spells (everything she offers). If she offers a mage quest, take it: the logger records it
T 97237 @ Stormwind City, 38.7, 62.2 | Roy Lewells, in the Park, north-west of the Mage Quarter
T 399 | Baros Alexston, in Cathedral Square
T 1097 | Grimand Elmore, in the Dwarven District
A 353 | Keep it: the package goes to Mountaineer Stormpike in Loch Modan
T 92748 @ Stormwind City, 62.0, 30.8 | Sprite Jumpsprocket, an engineer in the Dwarven District. Stop here: her next quest needs 10 Rough Dynamite and the chain ends in the Deadmines
